rce=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32F0mj48Mp6bSHwd4url6h\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/</span></a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Katherine Ransom<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, May 15, 2018 4:44 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> davis-rug &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: [D-RUG]: Change plotting order of categories of data in tmap map R<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I see you are sorting by area in the script, but I don&#39;t understand how this would apply to specifying plotting order? <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Tue, May 15, 2018, 4:29 PM Michele M Tobias &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0in\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Here’s how I’ve dealt with a similar question:\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/UCDavisLibrary/ava/blob/master/rcode/mergeGeoJson.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/UCDavisLibrary/ava/blob/master/rcode/mergeGeoJson.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wm7tI-zOGya8hHXJJTDxn\">\r\nhttps://github.com/UCDavisLibrary/ava/blob/master/rcode/mergeGeoJson.R</a>  The sorting starts at line 39.  The order is based on polygon area in this example.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Michele</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">GIS Data Curator</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Data Management Program</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">161 Shields Library</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32F0mj48Mp6bSHwd4url6h\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/</span></a>\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Katherine Ransom<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, May 15, 2018 4:22 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> davis-rug &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [D-RUG]: Change plotting order of categories of data in tmap map R</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/q/50358918/2816955\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/q/50358918/2816955&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PcM7eINf2Ro34VEAnB0Ga\">https://stackoverflow.com/q/50358918/2816955</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi DRUG,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have posted this question on SO regarding defining the plot order of categories for spatial points. I want to be able to make points overlap according to their designated categories.\r\n I&#39;ve done this in GIS, is there a way in R without making a spatial points data frame for each category?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Katie <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">--\r\n<br>\r\nCheck out our R resources at <a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GRmbuCXS7em5U7PntjCsv\">http://d-rug.github.io/</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Davis R Users&#39; Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davis-rug+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KEelrIo8v4dGBU2V57eyp\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Wwi1ksyQMhpHkKdRoOypp\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nCheck out our R resources at <a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Jqbrw8CNGksrkLIvJ6RnT\">http://d-rug.github.io/</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Davis R Users&#39; Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davis-rug+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw170br8mtJVE0g6fKggM7JB\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DWG3-jF-f-Rjn7kYz-Czf\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nCheck out our R resources at <a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Jqbrw8CNGksrkLIvJ6RnT\">http://d-rug.github.io/</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Davis R Users&#39; Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davis-rug+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw170br8mtJVE0g6fKggM7JB\">https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466477268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DWG3-jF-f-Rjn7kYz-Czf\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div></div>"
